      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "You need to look your best. Grab a crisp white structured Men's Shirt, iron it well, and tuck it into a pair of dark navy or charcoal [Men's Chinos](https://cottonworld.net/search?type=product&q=mens+chinos). Add a dark brown leather belt and matching dress shoes. It is sharp, authoritative, and completely comfortable.",
