      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "Take a light blue or subtly striped cotton shirt and pair it with classic khaki Men's Pants. Roll the sleeves up twice to expose your forearms for a slightly more relaxed, hardworking aesthetic.",
