      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "Ditch the button-down. Throw on a dark, solid-colored [Men's Polo](https://cottonworld.net/search?type=product&q=mens+polo) (black or navy works best) and tuck it into olive green chinos. It shows you know how to dress down without looking sloppy.",
